    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>THE AIM</b>

    Get closer to 21 than your opponent. Go over and you
    bust.

    Both of you start with 40 chips. Run out and you lose the match.


    <b>A
    ROUND</b>

    A shared card in the middle counts for both players.

    Everyone
    gets one card. Your newest card stays hidden from your opponent.

    Take turns:
    click the deck to draw, or ring your bell to stand.


    <b>ACES</b>

    Before
    the reveal, click each ace in your hand to make it 1 or 11.


    <b>BETTING</b>

    Each
    player puts in 1 chip. Then CALL, RAISE or DIE.

    To raise, press RAISE, click
    your chips, then CONFIRM.

    Dying gives up the pot. Die while your opponent
    busted and you pay 5 more.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 051a142e178e3ad4a8020061c29de2cd, type: 2}
