  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>WHO WINS</b>

    Not busting beats busting. Otherwise closest to 21
    wins.

    On a tie, the highest card wins (spade, diamond, heart, clover).


    <b>THE
    JOKER</b>

    Draw the joker and you lose the round at once and pay 10 chips.


    <b>ITEMS</b>

    Lose
    two rounds in a row and you get an item.

    Magnifier: peek at the next card
    while drawing.

    Bribe: swap your newest card while drawing.

    Flash: steal
    3 chips during betting.


    <b>CHARACTERS</b>

    King: 3 item slots.   Queen:
    5 extra chips.

    Jack: 30% chance to keep a used item.

    Joker: hides a
    joker in the deck, but never gets items.


    <b>TURNS</b>

    A high card
    decides who leads the first round. After that the loser leads.

    Each turn
    has 20 seconds.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 051a142e178e3ad4a8020061c29de2cd, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -4601769037901718366, guid: 051a142e178e3ad4a8020061c29de2cd, type: 2}
